          "text": "Urinary urgency and associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild urgency; no incontinence. Denies dysuria, haematuria, flank or loin pain, fever, rigors, nausea or vomiting. Stream is okay; denies hesitancy, incomplete emptying, visible lower abdominal swelling, or leakage between voids."
      }
    },
